{"id":"ad8ab2e9124a5a20","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-instanton.md","title":"Instanton","display":"df-instanton — Instanton","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-instanton","aliases":["58-df-instanton"],"display":"df-instanton — Instanton","depends_on":["[[58-df-principal-bundle]]","[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[58-df-hodge-star]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-instanton"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-instanton</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-instanton — Instanton"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d5f05282b5c6816\" href=\"?note=5d5f05282b5c6816\" title=\"58-df-principal-bundle\">58-df-principal-bundle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" href=\"?note=c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" title=\"58-df-hodge-star\">58-df-hodge-star</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Instanton}_S\\subseteq V^{15}\">\\(\\mathrm{Instanton}_S\\subseteq V^{15}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orientable}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Orientable}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,F_A,*_g,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,g,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G,n\\in V\">\\(A,F_A,*_g,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,g,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G,n\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\\)</span> (metric and orientation predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\\)</span> (ten-place predicate with group identity, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d5f05282b5c6816\" href=\"?note=5d5f05282b5c6816\" title=\"58-df-principal-bundle\">58-df-principal-bundle</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S\\)</span> are gauge-theoretic metapredicates: the current closure defines vector-bundle connections and ordinary forms, not adjoint-bundle connections and forms</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Instanton}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Instanton}_S\\)</span> (anti-self-dual connection predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}instanton} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Instanton}_S(A,F_A,*_g,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,g,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land n=4\\land\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\land\n\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S(F_A,A,p,P,M,G)\\land\n\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S(*_g,M,g,P,2)\\land *_g(F_A)=-F_A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}instanton} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Instanton}_S(A,F_A,*_g,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,g,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land n=4\\land\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\land\n\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S(F_A,A,p,P,M,G)\\land\n\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S(*_g,M,g,P,2)\\land *_g(F_A)=-F_A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The metric, orientation dimension, group identity, complete principal-bundle data, curvature witness, and induced Hodge star are explicit.  The gauge-specific predicates are marked metatheoretic instead of being presented as if they were supplied by the ordinary connection/Hodge-star atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-principal-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"5d5f05282b5c6816","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-principal-bundle]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hodge-star","status":"resolved","id":"c8c26f9dc2425e2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hodge-star]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-principal-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"5d5f05282b5c6816","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S$ (ten-place predicate with group identity, see [[58-df-principal-bundle]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Instanton}_S\\subseteq V^{15}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orientable}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"A,F_A,*_g,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,g,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Instanton}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}instanton} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Instanton}_S(A,F_A,*_g,p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,g,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land n=4\\land\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{PrincipalConnection}_S(A,p,P,M,G,\\rho)\\land\n\\mathrm{CurvatureOfPrincipalConnection}_S(F_A,A,p,P,M,G)\\land\n\\mathrm{TwistedHodgeStar}_S(*_g,M,g,P,2)\\land *_g(F_A)=-F_A","display":true}],"bytes":2126,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-692","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-instanton.md|58-df-instanton]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["5d5f05282b5c6816","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","c8c26f9dc2425e2f"]}